sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CMD as Command Facade
  participant EV as Event Log
  participant Out as Outbox
  participant Disp as Dispatcher
  participant SSE as SSE Client
  participant File as File Channel
  participant Hook as Webhook
  participant Sub as Subscriber
  CMD->>EV: append(event, idempotency_key)
  EV-->>CMD: seq + event_id
  EV->>Out: enqueue(deliveries)
  Out->>Disp: claim due delivery
  par 并行投递
    Disp->>SSE: send(event)
    Disp->>File: append JSONL
    Disp->>Hook: POST + HMAC signature
  end
  alt 投递失败
    Disp->>Out: retry schedule / dead letter
    Out->>EV: append push.dead_letter
  else 投递成功
    Disp->>Out: mark delivered
  end
  SSE-->>Sub: event + Last-Event-ID
  Note over CMD,Out: 推送失败不改变任务状态；task.completed 只发一次
